{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell asleep studying for exams, but when you woke up the school was empty. Survive the night, identify what\u2019s wrong, and escape the loop... or be stuck at school forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study Time Anomaly should take around 30 to 90 minutes to complete across the multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search the school</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/1bf4c1449b0114d30e6522f06094fb16.poster.avif?t=1764356960\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/1bf4c1449b0114d30e6522f06094fb16.webm?t=1764356960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/1bf4c1449b0114d30e6522f06094fb16.mp4?t=1764356960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something isn't quite right. You fell asleep while studying and are stuck in your school hallway...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/85a7981aebee95da4168a5f6407ce8b8.poster.avif?t=1764356960\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/85a7981aebee95da4168a5f6407ce8b8.webm?t=1764356960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/85a7981aebee95da4168a5f6407ce8b8.mp4?t=1764356960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for anomalies ranging from curious to lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape... or not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/b041589c9b40763daad32590af2df29e.poster.avif?t=1764356960\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/b041589c9b40763daad32590af2df29e.webm?t=1764356960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/b041589c9b40763daad32590af2df29e.mp4?t=1764356960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the correct staircase to finally escape the loop and go home... or be stuck forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 anomalies to spot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the environment for anomalies and choose the correct stairs to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies that change across floors based on your decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Who closed that door?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907440/f4a62bd6733d2775418991b162b95703c168b1fa.jpg"},{"name":"Cram School","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907440/a9b007955fd39466e8877246c4e8ec8c2d0043c7.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Student","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907440/8b9e71a6d7e89623ebccf858fa7ba07a6d249111.jpg"},{"name":"Study Time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.